meta {
  name: GPS delete - refuses an unbounded delete
  type: http
  seq: 46
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/gps
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  deviceId: 08:D1:F9:C8:4D:24
}

docs {
  Guard rail: a deviceId-only delete would wipe the boat's ENTIRE
  history, so the route requires an explicit start and/or end.

  Expect 400: start and/or end required — refusing to delete unbounded
  history.

  Only reached when ENABLE_GPS_EDIT is set on the server.
}
